        "id": 1121198
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-20T19:36:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On old devices we get the EID from getEid. On new devices, we populate it in the constructor from IccCardStatus or in update() using IccCardStatus, so its okay, right? If the IccCardStatus contains EID on bootup then it should continue to contain EID when we request updates.",
